WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.059 --> 00:00:03.726
(dramatic orchestral music)

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:35.040
- Standing at 28 feet and
weighing in at five tons,

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:37.730
the LW-Mononofu is a life-sized robot

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:39.423
that was built by one man.

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:53.580
Masaaki works as an
engineer at Sakakibara,

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:56.010
a company that develops
machines for agriculture.

00:00:56.010 --> 00:00:57.950
But they also make
life-sized robots that people

00:00:57.950 --> 00:01:00.100
can operate for fun, and Masaaki,

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:02.692
along with his colleagues,
have built them all.

00:01:02.692 --> 00:01:04.859
(roaring)

00:01:18.781 --> 00:01:20.900
So when Masaaki's job
tasked him with creating

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:23.410
a robot to help promote
the company, he referenced

00:01:23.410 --> 00:01:25.847
one of his favorite
animes as a kid, right?

00:01:47.110 --> 00:01:49.680
- But just building the robot
wasn't enough for Masaaki.

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:51.580
He wanted something that
was bigger and better

00:01:51.580 --> 00:01:53.320
than his previous models.

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:54.980
He poured his heart and soul into making

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:58.150
the LW-Mononofu fully operational.

00:01:58.150 --> 00:02:02.400
It can move its arms,
its legs, it has a gun

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:04.100
that shoots sponge balls.

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:05.650
It's his greatest creation yet.

